            "title": "HPE will lead in AI networking after closing Juniper deal: CEO",
            "description": "<p>Hewlett Packard Enterprise (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HPE\">HPE</a>) had a blowout third quarter, reporting significant sales and revenue growth while topping earnings expectations.</p>\n<p>HPE CEO Antonio Neri sits down with Yahoo Finance executive editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> to expand upon the company's AI networking strategy after closing its acquisition of Juniper Networks, its competition with Cisco Systems (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CSCO\">CSCO</a>), and its GreenLake cloud platform.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>\n<p><em>Editor's note: This video has been updated to better reflect the company's video and title.</em></p>",
